[{"verse":1,"text":"Or, acts."},{"verse":2,"text":"2.King.17. 3. , Or, Kedes of Nephthali in Galile, Judg.4.6."},{"verse":5,"text":"1.King.12. 30. Or, to the power of Baal, or the god Baal."},{"verse":6,"text":"Exod. 22. 29. deu.12. 6."},{"verse":7,"text":"Or, Levi."},{"verse":9,"text":"Num.36. 7."},{"verse":10,"text":"Gene.43. 32."},{"verse":11,"text":"Greek, my soul."},{"verse":13,"text":"Greek. byer."},{"verse":14,"text":"Or, in the land or country of Media."},{"verse":15,"text":"Gr, the ways of whom were unsettled."},{"verse":17,"text":"Or, behind walls."},{"verse":18,"text":"2. Kin. 19. 35,36. isai. 37.36,37. ecclus.48. 18,12.1. macc.7.41. 2.mac. 8. 19."},{"verse":21,"text":"2.King. 19.37. 2. chr.32.21. , Or, Esar-Haddon."},{"verse":22,"text":"Or, Esar-Haddon."}]